  "description": "Being a death-metal-singing RPG fangirl is a tough job, but someone’s gotta do it. Between part-timing at an adult toy store and struggling to get her death metal career off the ground, Se-Rin spends all of her remaining time romancing her favorite video game character, the paladin Alaistar Chiffon. Then one day, fantasy romances become reality when she awakens in the game's world as a siren! However, although there are plenty of good times to be had as a sexy siren, not everything is fun and games in this fantastical world…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
